---
pageType: page
title: "About Monthaven Home Buyers | Who We Are & Why We Buy Houses Here"
description: "Who Monthaven is, how we operate in Gaston and Cleveland County NC, and what we will and won't do. Real people, real offers, no call center."
breadcrumbs:
  - name: "Home"
    url: "/"
  - name: "About"
    url: "/about/"
---
{% from "components/lead-form.njk" import leadForm with context %}
{% import "components/blocks.njk" as b with context %}

<section class="section section--soft">
  <div class="wrap--narrow">
    <p class="eyebrow">About us</p>
    <h1>We're local buyers, not a lead broker.</h1>
    <p class="lead mt-5">
      A lot of the "we buy houses" sites you'll find for Gastonia and Shelby aren't buyers
      at all. They collect your address and sell it to whoever pays most for the lead, which
      is why you get eleven calls. We buy the houses ourselves.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap--narrow stack-lg">
    {% set realTeam = [] %}
    {% for t in proof.team %}{% if not t.placeholder %}{% set realTeam = (realTeam.push(t), realTeam) %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}

    {% if realTeam.length %}
    <h2>Who you'll be dealing with</h2>
    {% for t in realTeam %}
    <div class="card">
      <h3>{{ t.name }}{% if t.role %} &mdash; {{ t.role }}{% endif %}</h3>
      <p>{{ t.bio }}</p>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
    {% else %}
    <p class="placeholder-note">
      <strong>Team bios and photos pending.</strong> This is the highest-value trust block on the
      whole site and the single biggest E-E-A-T signal we have. It stays empty rather than
      carrying a stock photo and invented copy. Add real names, roles, photos and first-person
      bios to <code>src/_data/proof.json</code>.
    </p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--warm">
  <div class="wrap--narrow stack-lg">
    <h2>How we operate</h2>
    <p><strong>We look at the house.</strong> Someone from Monthaven walks every property in
    person before we make an offer. We don't send algorithmic numbers and then "adjust" after
    the walkthrough.</p>
    <p><strong>We put it in writing.</strong> Verbal offers are how people get moved off a number
    later. Ours comes in writing with the math behind it.</p>
    <p><strong>We don't re-trade you on condition.</strong> We walk the house before we price
    it, and once you sign, the number doesn't move because of what's in it. No repair
    renegotiation, no inspection deduction. This is the most common complaint about cash
    buyers and it's the one thing we won't do. The only things that can void a contract are
    outside both our hands, and we name them up front rather than bury them.</p>
    <p><strong>We tell you when to walk away.</strong> If listing with an agent would net you
    more, or if a repayment plan with your servicer solves the problem, we'll say so. We'd
    rather lose the deal.</p>
    <p><strong>We don't sell your information.</strong> Your address and phone number go to us,
    not to a list.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap--narrow stack-lg">
    <h2>What we are not</h2>
    <p>
      We're a real estate investment company. We buy houses directly with our own funds,
      renovate them, and either sell or hold them. We are not real estate agents, we don't
      list properties, and we don't represent you in a transaction. We're not attorneys,
      accountants, or financial advisors, and nothing on this site is legal, tax, or
      financial advice.
    </p>
    <p class="small muted">
      {{ site.name }} is a trade name of {{ site.legalName }}.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

{{ b.ctaBand() }}

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap--narrow">{{ leadForm("bottom-form", "full") }}</div>
</section>
